Axiom Rlt_one_third_1 : Rlt one_third 1.
Axiom minus_1_lt_minus_one_third_SNo : (minus_SNo 1) < (minus_SNo one_third).
Axiom Rlt_minus1_minus_one_third : Rlt (minus_SNo 1) (minus_SNo one_third).
Axiom closed_interval_minus_one_third_one_third_sub_closed_interval_minus1_1 : closed_interval (minus_SNo one_third) one_third c= closed_interval (minus_SNo 1) 1.
